    <briefdescription>
<para>Translates key presses to <ref refid="classaction_1_1_list" kindref="compound">List</ref> actions via a single lookup table. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classaction_1_1_row" kindref="compound">Row</ref> 0 selected = search mode (typing filters). <ref refid="classaction_1_1_row" kindref="compound">Row</ref> &gt; 0 = navigation. Binding mode is handled by <ref refid="classaction_1_1_list" kindref="compound">List</ref> directly, not by <ref refid="classaction_1_1_key_handler" kindref="compound">KeyHandler</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
